Today is Tuesday.
We are in the office in the morning.
Our short morning meeting takes place.
Suresh, Rohan, Priya, and Vikram are here.
Suresh looks at me.
He asks, "Maya, what all have you done?"
I speak confidently.
"I have read the details of the new project."
"I have created a technical plan."
I open my laptop.
I show my plan to everyone.
"I have also written the initial code."
Priya and Vikram listen attentively.
Suresh is satisfied.
He says, "Maya, this is excellent work."
Rohan also agrees with that.
I am ready for the upcoming work.
